msgstr "Ala kirjoittaa nimeä"

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: the person being invited deleted their account meanwhile. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "that account no longer exists"
msgstr "Tiliä ei ole enää olemassa."

#. An error from the server: the Apple ID used is not the one linked to this account.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "That Apple ID isn't the one this account signs in with."
msgstr "Tämä Apple ID ei ole se, jolla tähän tiliin kirjaudutaan."

#. A change made earlier, refused when it reached the server.
#: src/lib/listsApi.ts
msgid "That change is no longer valid."
msgstr "Muutos ei ole enää voimassa."

#. A change made earlier is waiting: the item it was made to has since been deleted (put in the bin).
#: src/components/BlockedBanner.tsx
msgid "That item is in the bin. Restore it and keep your change?"
msgstr "Tuote on roskakorissa. Palautetaanko se ja säilytetäänkö muutoksesi?"

#. A change made earlier is waiting: the list it was made to has since been deleted (put in the bin).
#: src/components/BlockedBanner.tsx
msgid "That list is in the bin. Restore it and keep your change?"
msgstr "Lista on roskakorissa. Palautetaanko se ja säilytetäänkö muutoksesi?"

#. A refusal from the server when another account already uses this name, under the name field on Set name and Account. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "that name is taken"
msgstr "Nimi on jo käytössä."

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: the member whose role was changed, or who was removed, has already left. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "that person is not a member of this list"
msgstr "Henkilö ei ole tämän listan jäsen."

#. Title when the bin (the deleted lists or items) is empty.
#. Title when the bin (the deleted lists or items) is empty.
#: src/screens/ListDetailScreen.tsx
#: src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx
msgid "The bin is empty"
msgstr "Roskakori on tyhjä"

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: the person being invited is already a member of the list. "they" is one person whose gender is unknown: avoid gendered forms. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "they already have this list"
msgstr "Hänellä on jo tämä lista."

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: the person being invited already has an open invitation to the list. "they" is one person whose gender is unknown: avoid gendered forms. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "they have already been invited"
msgstr "Hänet on jo kutsuttu."

#. An error from the server, on Account when deleting an account that does not sign in with Apple.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "This account doesn't sign in with Apple."
msgstr "Tämä tili ei käytä Kirjaudu Applella -toimintoa."

#. Under an Apple Hide My Email address. “Sign in with Apple” is Apple's feature: use the name Apple uses in this language.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "This address hides your real email. On another iPhone, use Sign in with Apple. On Android or the web, sign in with this address, and Apple forwards the code to your inbox."
msgstr "Tämä osoite piilottaa oikean sähköpostiosoitteesi. Käytä toisella iPhonella Kirjaudu Applella -toimintoa. Androidilla tai verkossa kirjaudu tällä osoitteella, niin Apple välittää koodin sähköpostiisi."

#. A refusal from the server on the Notifications or Sharing screen: the invitation was already answered or withdrawn. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this invitation is no longer open"
msgstr "Kutsu ei ole enää avoinna."

#. A refusal from the server on the Notifications screen: the person who sent the invitation is no longer an owner of the list. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this invitation is no longer valid"
msgstr "Kutsu ei ole enää voimassa."

#. A refusal from the server on the Notifications screen: the list in the invitation was put in the bin. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this list has been deleted"
msgstr "Lista on poistettu."

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: nobody can be invited to a list in the bin. "the bin" is where deleted lists wait 30 days. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this list is in the bin"
msgstr "Lista on roskakorissa."

#. On a deleted list's own screen. “Show deleted” is the switch of that name: use its translation.
#: src/screens/ListDetailScreen.tsx
msgid "This list is in the bin. Restoring it brings back everything except the items you deleted separately — those are one tick of Show deleted away."
msgstr "Tämä lista on roskakorissa. Kun palautat sen, kaikki palautuu paitsi erikseen poistamasi tuotteet – ne saat näkyviin Näytä poistetut -valinnalla."

#. The confirm under Sign out of all devices: what it does.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "This signs every device out, not just this one."
msgstr "Tämä kirjaa ulos kaikki laitteet, ei vain tätä."

